      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "Impersonation Trail",
      "questDescription": "DataSequence CEO George Wilkerson has asked you to examine the public information surrounding a social media impersonation incident. Use Cyber Search to corroborate a named association, distinguish discoverable facts from assumptions about the impersonator, and recommend a proportionate response.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>George Wilkerson:</b> You confirmed that my friendship with Eli Masters was publicly discoverable without claiming that a particular source caused the incident. Your recommendations focus on reducing unnecessary exposure and making official DataSequence communications easier to verify.",
